WEBVTT

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:12.310
Damn it! Damn it!

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.080
Damn it!

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:19.030
I had him!

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.380
I fucking had him!

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:25.260
Senpai!

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.640
I-I'm sorry, I didn't mean to spy on you.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.940
I just wanted to apologize.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.010
I shouldn't have done what I did in the last battle.

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:43.940
I'm really sorry!

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:45.450
No, it's...

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:53.370
Senpai, are you okay?

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.900
I'm fine.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:01.380
But, Senpai, you haven't gotten Krieger-sick once since training.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:09.180
Senpai?

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:13.390
Please don't tell the others.

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:14.940
I don't want to be a burden.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.320
Alright.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:19.560
Thanks.

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:26.240
And don't worry about what happened in the battle.

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:35.450
Tokimune, did you do something weird?

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:39.710
The terminal screen just went all crazy.

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:43.630
No, I didn't do anything.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:45.710
I see. Thanks.

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:59.650
Someday, in this space deprived of hope,
kono takaki mubou no kuu de itsuka

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:04.320
you'll kneel of your own will.
sono ishi wa hiza wo tateru

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:15.540
break up foreordination

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:20.420
Was that flame an illusion or a friend?
fake ano hi wa nakama ka

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:25.130
Am I to venture into the darkness?
susumu beki wa yami ka

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:34.430
You'll find nameless emotions beyond the protruding knife.
knife tsukitateta saki ni shoutai no mienu kanjou

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:40.270
I can't let this end here yet.
ima wa mada koko de owarenai

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:45.400
I need to get ready to survive.
naraba ikiru junbi wo shiro yo

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:50.700
The passion in my heart only burns hotter.
uzu takaku tsumiageteku netsujou

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:54.200
Needless to say, it burdens me.
omotai ni kimatten darou

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.240
wake up your tough intention
Needless to say, it burdens me.
omotai ni kimatten darou

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:55.660
wake up your tough intention

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:56.620
Go ahead and mock my inexperience on the battlefield.
mijuku da to warau ga ii sa senjou

00:02:56.620 --> 00:03:00.870
mijuku da to warau ga ii sa senjou
Go ahead and mock my inexperience on the battlefield.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:07.510
I'll show you what I've got, bit by bit,
hitotsu zutsu tashikamete yaru kara

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:09.050
so bring it on.
kakattekoi

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.560
break up foreordination

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:25.320
Sturm

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:29.030
Your suggestion of a retreat to Pudder has been approved.
Sturm

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:29.650
Sturm

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.540
Is something wrong?

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.390
I didn't say anything.

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:35.450
Don't try to fool me.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:40.030
For our army, that's a remarkably fast decision.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.480
I was just surprised.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:43.080
Now, that's not very nice.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:43.960
It's the truth.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.960
We failed to capture the enemy's new model,

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.570
but we have data on it, if nothing else.

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:54.590
It's overwhelmingly strong and fast,
and very similar to Argevollen.

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:56.440
Correct?

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:57.200
Yes.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.500
Your request to regroup at Pudder

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:04.600
to be ready for its next attack makes a lot of sense.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.110
There's nothing strange about it.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:09.680
All right. As soon as we've readied our wounded for transport,

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.980
we'll make for Pudder.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.110
Good luck.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:23.490
Why did the enemy leave us?

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:25.640
The game changed.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.180
The enemy's objective changed.

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:32.130
It's probably to destroy Argevollen now.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.870
It looked a lot like Argevollen.

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:39.850
Yeah.

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:41.830
And it's coming back.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:43.050
You're right.

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:48.150
Are we playing into someone's plan?

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:58.800
Excuse me.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:02.370
Seiran 3 is inoperable.

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:05.990
The mechanics tell me it needs parts swapped out.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:06.990
Thank you.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.920
Is Private Portman hurt?

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.680
She's a little down,

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:13.170
but it'll be good medicine for her.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.100
You're right.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:16.180
What about the others?

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:17.680
They're fine.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:20.380
They're all eager to take down the Ghost at the next chance.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.460
We've spent a lot of time on all of them.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:26.940
I'm having the 8th Unit withdraw.

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:31.140
You don't want Argevollen defeating that new model so easily, right?

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.280
Or the other way around.

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:34.940
Oh, I don't know.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:37.200
I don't think it's something to be worried about.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:41.330
So you sent something that powerful to the enemy?

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:46.290
As I've said many times, it's not one of my company's products.

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:48.210
Oh, of course.

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:52.730
Anyway, I won't waste the situation you've set up for us.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.120
Just a little more.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:06:00.580
I feel like I'm waiting for my chance with a hot chick.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:04.310
As soon as it's time, I'm raring to have a go.

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.980
It's hot...

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:17.770
It's only 7:00 AM.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:20.360
What's it going to be like when it hits noon?

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:23.370
I'm worried about the wounded.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:29.390
Will you loosen up already?

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.330
It's fine to concentrate, but don't get obsessed.

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.420
It'll break you.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.170
Right.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:41.900
I'm not seeing any bug reports...

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.050
Does that mean it's a feature?

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:49.320
You're working hard, Jamie-chan.

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:51.100
And in this heat, too.

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.490
I need to work hard at times like these.

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:57.690
Once the fighting starts, I can't do anything.

00:06:57.690 --> 00:06:58.940
I like that.

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.800
Um, Jamie-san?

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:04.450
What?

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:12.230
What's wrong?

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:14.880
Um...

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:17.210
Your bra is showing.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:25.760
We're detouring to the west.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:30.140
But some of Kitazamahara's units are wounded.

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:33.370
They'll take the shortest route, as planned.

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:35.150
We'll be the only ones to detour.

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:39.660
With that in mind, send a request for aid to HQ via normal channels.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:41.750
Not that it'll come.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:46.660
So we're telling the enemy where we are?

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:47.660
That's right.

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:51.060
Understood.

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:53.440
Corporal Terai, contact the other vehicles.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:54.170
Yes, ma'am.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:04.790
I guess you weren't incompetent enough to have problems here.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.260
Second Lieutenant Richthofen,

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:09.710
we just intercepted an Arandas transmission.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:14.140
Argevollen's unit is heading to Pudder via the west.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:17.150
We've found their route from the contents of the transmission.

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.530
The Sturm Alpha can catch them.

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:24.540
Destroy Argevollen.

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:26.910
I believe that's what you're after.

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:28.530
Not just me.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.960
I'm on my way.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:43.050
Your strength and tenacity are the key to my revenge.

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:54.040
This is Seeker.

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.190
The Ghost took the bait.

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:56.810
Roger.

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:59.690
Go on ahead after this, as originally planned.

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:02.650
It came alone?

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:05.070
It'll do that if it has to.

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:09.920
From its estimated movement speed,

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:12.590
it'll reach us in about two hours.

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:15.560
We'll be fighting in the middle of the desert.

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:16.960
No, not the desert.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:35.060
This is really famous among big fans of ruins,

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:38.060
but it's not a place you get many chances to see.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:40.810
It's been called a chimeral rare spot!

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:43.010
So you're a big fan of ruins.

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:43.720
Wha-?

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.970
Well no, a friend of mine...

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:47.480
You don't have to hide it.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.000
It's a fine hobby.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.320
I-I'm really not!

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.280
Here it is!

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:02.000
We should be grateful that the people here in the past didn't get rid of these.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:05.880
It'd be nice if they'd kept them a little more organized, though.

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.880
Okay, let's hurry.

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:11.850
Our objective this time is the new model's destruction.

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:13.850
Seiran 1 will be stationed in the northeast.

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:16.310
Seiran 2 will be on standby in the southeast.

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:18.720
The enemy will most likely come from one of those directions.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.160
It'd be ideal if we could defeat it there,

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.150
but that's not likely to happen.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.900
Once the enemy enters the city,

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:28.950
Private Susumu, it's all yours.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:29.660
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:34.300
Sergeant Tanita and the others will be sending you coordinates momentarily.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.790
Argevollen will need to lure the enemy to that point.

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:40.580
Once it gets near the point,

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.790
we'll destroy this entire plant.

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:46.480
I'll say this just in case.

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:50.090
I believe the enemy will target Argevollen specifically.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:54.930
This battle will be unlike any you've ever experienced.

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:59.720
If you hear my voice, do as I tell you, no matter what.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.020
No exceptions.

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:02.440
Yes, sir.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:10.980
This is Seiran 1.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.410
No sign of the Ghost.

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:16.660
Seiran 2. Just sitting here waiting.

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.300
Bring it.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:22.320
Bring it!

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.540
<i>Bring it!</i>

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:33.130
Sabotage team, how's progress on your end?

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.890
Sorry, we're still selecting a target area.

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.750
How about here?

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.140
Adjustment valve 15.

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:43.140
Would that work?

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.300
Yeah.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.540
It would spread out nice and even here.

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:47.770
All right, Yamanami.

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.020
Right!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.410
We have the target area.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:51.780
Adjustment valve 15!

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:53.280
Let's get it set up!

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:54.420
Right!

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:58.160
All units, the target point is adjustment valve 15!

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:00.270
Sending coordinate data!

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:01.880
This is Lorenz.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.290
Our guest is coming in via the back door.

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:08.920
Table for one Ghost.

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:11.730
He circled around?

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:12.860
Tokimune!

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:15.130
Already on my way!

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:23.270
Come on, dive right in...

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:40.490
It's okay. I'm used to the cold shoulder treatment.

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:56.620
So it's heading straight for Arge, huh?

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:58.430
You're so popular, Tokimune!

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:02.230
From the southeast...

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:03.060
Which means...

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:06.460
Argevollen, the explosives aren't in place yet.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.060
Buy us some time.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:08.940
Roger!

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:20.620
He's coming.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:42.830
Pressure's looking good!

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:48.060
It's close! Hurry!

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:00.540
Argevollen, you're too close to the sabotage team.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.900
The explosives still aren't ready?

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:03.790
No.

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.550
Hang in there until they've left.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:07.450
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:18.170
I've been waiting for this moment, Argevollen!

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.430
You're fast, but that's all!

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.520
Your movements are as gutless as ever.

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:35.400
You're new, and that's all! So shut up!

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:43.860
Tokimune!

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.320
Sergeant Tanita, what's the situation?

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.960
One minute, no, 45 seconds!

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:51.380
Just a little longer, Private Susumu!

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:02.340
Damn it! Damn it!

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:04.090
Die.

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:16.670
Argevollen! Come in! Argevollen!

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:19.460
You bastard! Bastard!

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.570
Damn it!

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:23.100
Private Susumu, can you hear me?

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:24.070
Answer me!

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:26.740
Fall! Fall!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:28.500
He should be hearing you.

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:33.020
Tokimune?

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:35.140
Please, Tokimune! Answer me!

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:36.330
Tokimune, come on!

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:39.090
Why?

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:40.670
This is Tanita.

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:41.880
The explosives are in place.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:43.120
Roger.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.800
Get away from the target area.

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:47.110
Listen to me, Private Susumu.

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:49.680
Shake off the enemy now and get out of...

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:51.810
Silfy.

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:53.810
Roger.

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:56.060
Seiran 1, on my way.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:58.190
Tokimune, what are you doing?

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.380
Everybody, run!

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:18.870
Tokimune!

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.780
Tokimune, what's gotten into you?

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:22.540
Answer me, Tokimune!

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.700
What's wrong? Please answer me!
Private Susumu, come in!

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:25.070
What's wrong? Please answer me!

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:25.690
Private Susumu! Come in!

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:27.070
Tokimune, come on!
Private Susumu! Come in!

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:27.640
Private Susumu! Come in!

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:28.470
Private—

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:44.240
Get off him for just a second, Tokimune!

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:49.990
Okay!

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.020
What's happening?

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:12.790
This is impossible!

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:14.600
There were no problems with Argevollen.

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:16.600
And Tokimune said he was fine!

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:18.310
He's not!

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:21.340
I saw it!

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:23.780
Senpai was throwing up this morning!

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.680
He looked really sick.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:28.070
He was sweating really bad, and he was so irritable...

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:31.590
I thought it was weird.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:34.450
But he told me not to tell anyone.

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:38.210
He said he didn't want to burden the others.

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:39.810
So I...

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:40.960
I'm sorry!

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:46.280
Withdraw, Private Susumu.

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:51.350
Come in, Private Susumu!

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:52.350
Tokimune!

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:04.670
Tanita, detonate the explosives on my signal.

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:46.670
Do it.

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:47.920
Yes, sir.

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.480
Damn it!

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:11.180
Aregvollen's status?

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:12.540
Senpai's?

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:14.800
I don't know.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:17.240
He's not moving and there's no communication.

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:26.250
Stop it.

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:30.900
Who are you?

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:33.960
Stop it.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.370
We were right.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:36.770
It's still...

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:05.260
Oh... Jamie...

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:08.570
Where are we?

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:10.170
Pudder base.

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:12.880
When did we...

00:21:16.310 --> 00:21:18.960
I stopped him.

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:21.100
I...

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:22.310
It wasn't you.

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.640
Suzushiro.

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:27.690
Yes, sir.

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:40.810
Captain...

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:44.230
How are you feeling?

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:46.030
I feel fine.

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.370
I'm sorry.

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:51.210
Private Tokimune Susumu.

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:51.880
Yes, sir?

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:56.760
From now on, you are forbidden to pilot Argevollen.

00:21:58.020 --> 00:21:58.870
What?

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:13.150
We gaze into each other's eyes, open our hearts.

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:19.360
A cycle of strength and weakness.

00:22:19.360 --> 00:22:26.000
Your eyes must have adjusted somewhat.

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:32.670
Verbalize though I may,

00:22:32.670 --> 00:22:40.470
I remember that I can't

00:22:40.470 --> 00:22:47.100
rationalize everything

00:22:47.100 --> 00:22:54.270
The world will change, as long as I remain courageous.

00:22:55.520 --> 00:23:02.280
The telepathy I wouldn't have discovered alone,

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:08.410
leads me ahead, behind your dazzling silouette.

00:23:08.410 --> 00:23:15.790
But even so, I'll keep my unwavering gaze on you;

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:22.380
It'll reach you someday.

00:23:36.690 --> 00:23:39.650
Freeze
